stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Available: Valid acquisition or transfer to this owner
    Available --> Deployed: Valid owned placement with no incompatible lock
    Deployed --> Available: Recall / clear assignment and preserve identity
    Available --> MarketEscrow: Valid price and ownership / acquire listing lock
    MarketEscrow --> Available: Cancel or expiry / release same individual once
    MarketEscrow --> Transferred: Valid sale / change owner and remove seller access
    Available --> BreedingLocked: Valid job / acquire parent lock
    BreedingLocked --> Available: Job completes / release original parent once
    Transferred --> [*]
    note right of Available
      Valid listing requires the creature-specific
      price interval for species and Quality Rank.
      Conflicting listing / breeding requests have one winner.
    end note
    note right of BreedingLocked
      Claiming the offspring is separate from parent release.
      Only offspring creation allocates a new individual ID.
    end note
